- The name can contain digits, colons (:), underscores (_), periods (.), or hyphens (-).

If this parameter is not specified, the default value is the InstanceId of the instance.', example='test：Instance_Name.1-2', position='Query'),
  instanceType: string(name='InstanceType', description='The instance type.

