- **cloud_efficiency**: ultra cloud disk
- **cloud_ssd**: all-flash cloud disk
- **local_hdd**: local HDD
- **local_ssd**: local SSD', example='cloud_efficiency'),
      encrypted?: boolean(name='Encrypted', description='Specifies whether to encrypt the cloud disk. Valid values:

- true: encrypts the cloud disk.

- false (default): does not encrypt the cloud disk.', example='false'),
      KMSKeyId?: string(name='KMSKeyId', description='The ID of the KMS key used by the cloud disk. Valid values:

- true: encrypts the cloud disk.

- false (default): does not encrypt the cloud disk.

> If Encrypted is set to true and KMSKeyId is empty, the default service key is used.', example='false'),
      size?: long(name='Size', description='The size of the data cloud disk. Unit: GiB.', example='20'),
    }
