  instanceName?: string(name='InstanceName', description='The instance name. The name must be 2 to 128 characters in length and must start with a letter or Chinese character. It cannot start with `http://` or `https://`. It can contain Chinese characters, letters, digits, colons (:), underscores (_), periods (.), or hyphens (-).

