- **95BandwidthByMonth**: monthly 95th percentile bandwidth

> You can select a billing method only for the first purchase. Subsequent purchases use the billing method selected during the first purchase by default.', example='BandwidthByDay', position='Query'),
  internetMaxBandwidthOut?: long(name='InternetMaxBandwidthOut', description='The maximum public bandwidth. If the value of this parameter is greater than 0, a public IP address is automatically assigned to the instance.', example='1', position='Query'),
